#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:128
msgid "Aerobatic Tuning"
msgstr "特技调参"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:6
#: 9debf272ef664686b1f93a19e65a7512
msgid "Scripted Aerobatics"
msgstr "脚本化特技飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:9
#: 3b95da4060de4ff891ef4f27d2e3f0d8
msgid ""
"this capability is in ArduPlane 4.2 and higher. It is rapidly evolving. Its "
"suggested that users uses load the current \"Latest\" firmware and refer to "
"its matching doucmentation ( :ref:`common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4` ) for "
"best perfoemance."
msgstr ""
"此功能适用于 ArduPlane 4.2 及更高版本，正在快速演进。建议用户加载当前「最新版」固件并参考对应文档（:ref:`common-"
"scripted-aerobatics-4.4`）以获得最佳性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:11
#: 2a900d6bec6a464aae44169e6c0693ec
msgid ""
"ArduPilot has the capability of executing aerobatics from a LUA script. "
"Either via AUTO mode mission items, or via scripts executed in many normal "
"plane flight modes, usually controlled via a transmitter switch and "
"selection RC channels."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持通过 LUA 脚本执行特技飞行动作。既可通过 Auto "
"模式任务项执行，也可在许多正常固定翼飞行模式下通过脚本运行，通常由遥控器开关和选择 RC 通道进行控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:13
#: 231f504855e94e5a9a06473dec0dae5b
msgid ""
"this requires a vehicle capable of aerobatic flight, properly tuned "
"pitch,roll, and yaw rate controllers, and the pilot should be capable of "
"safely taking over control (by switch or mode change) the vehicle while in "
"an unusual attitude, if the need arises. The ``ACRO_x_RATE`` parameters "
"limit the maximum commanded rate for each axis, as in ACRO mode."
msgstr ""
"此功能要求飞机具备特技飞行能力，且俯仰、横滚和偏航速率控制器已正确调参。飞手应具备在飞机处于异常姿态时安全接管控制权（通过拨动开关或切换飞行模式）的能力。``ACRO_x_RATE``"
" 参数限制每个轴的最大指令速率，与 Acro 模式相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:16
#: 0eb5932c38e14a728978f84c12f6610e
msgid "Mission NAV_SCRIPT_TIME"
msgstr "任务 NAV_SCRIPT_TIME"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:18
#: a4302d00a3e741a6a583a003beca6519
msgid ""
"The SCRIPT_TIME waypoint type allows for a :ref:`LUA<common-lua-scripts>` "
"script to take control of the roll/pitch/yaw rates of the vehicle for a "
"time. For protection against lack of an appropriate script being active (ie "
"was not loaded in the APM/Scripts directory of the SD card) to assume "
"control, or LUA script crash due to error, there is a mandatory parameter "
"which provides a maximum time the script can takeover, before the next "
"mission item is executed."
msgstr ""
"SCRIPT_TIME 航点类型允许 :ref:`LUA<common-lua-scripts>` "
"脚本在一段时间内接管飞机横滚/俯仰/偏航速率控制。为防止合适的脚本未激活（即未加载到 SD 卡 APM/Scripts 目录）或 LUA "
"脚本因错误崩溃，设有一个强制参数用于指定脚本可接管的最大时间，超时后将执行下一个任务项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:20
#: 7a7563729c684dc98d30d326a70bdee4
msgid "The format of the SCRIPT_TIME item is:"
msgstr "SCRIPT_TIME 任务项的格式如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:70
#: 239f77d9fe1e46449b275b08c3f39254
msgid ""
"A LUA script would need to be running when the above mission command is "
"encountered to recognize that it needs to take control, and start sending "
"pitch/roll/yaw rate inputs into the autopilot to control its attitude and/or"
" trajectory. It can use the two variable input parameters of the command to "
"control aspects of the maneuver, such as rate of rolls/loops, repeat counts,"
" time for certain segments of the maneuver, etc. An example is provided in "
"the LUA Scripting examples directory called `plane_aerobatics.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/Aerobatics/FixedWing/plane_aerobatics.lua>`__"
" for several types of tricks."
msgstr ""
"当上述任务命令被触发时，需要有一个 LUA "
"脚本正在运行，以识别需要接管控制并开始向飞控发送俯仰/横滚/偏航速率输入来控制飞机姿态和/或轨迹。脚本可利用命令的两个可变输入参数来控制动作的各个方面，如横滚/循环的速率、重复次数、动作特定阶段的时间等。LUA"
" 脚本示例目录中提供了一个名为 `plane_aerobatics.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/Aerobatics/FixedWing/plane_aerobatics.lua>`__"
" 的示例，涵盖多种特技类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:72
#: 5456f1c1fea748b6ad75339b3615e657
msgid ""
"The execution of a script running during the NAV_SCRIPT_TIME item can easily"
" be interrupted by switching modes out of AUTO."
msgstr "在 NAV_SCRIPT_TIME 任务项执行期间运行的脚本，可通过切换出 Auto 模式来轻松中断。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:74
#: 4b5b9b68408a4834a8a3cdbb810736be
msgid ""
"returning to AUTO mode would resume the AUTO mission at the last item before"
" switching modes. If this was a NAV_SCRIPT_TIME command it would re-start "
"from the beginning."
msgstr ""
"返回 Auto 模式将从切换模式前的上一个任务项继续执行 Auto 任务。若该项为 NAV_SCRIPT_TIME 命令，则将从头重新开始。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:76
#: 266d65decbc84d039ebc6a83eed5423c
msgid ""
"be sure to have valid waypoints before and after a NAV_SCRIPT_TIME sequence "
"of commands in order to establish path for the scripts to use (optionally) "
"and to have sufficient altitude before trying this feature."
msgstr "请确保在 NAV_SCRIPT_TIME 命令序列前后设置有效航点，以便为脚本建立路径（可选），并在尝试此功能前确保有足够的飞行高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:78
#: d5b0534f23c54139b82794ba1c43fe78
msgid ""
"if you create your mission, and place the LUA script you intend to use in "
"the /scripts subdirectory of a SITL simulation, you can test the script and "
"the mission without risking your vehicle."
msgstr "若在 SITL 仿真的 /scripts 子目录中创建任务并放置计划使用的 LUA 脚本，可在不损坏实机的情况下测试脚本和任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:80
#: 55e1c18551064fb3b0ae233fc30cd7ff
msgid ""
"Here is a video of a SITL simulation of the above mentioned example script:"
msgstr "以下是上述示例脚本的 SITL 仿真视频："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:85
#: c61e690f56b642d8a4efc4dae91d16da
msgid "Tricks on a Switch"
msgstr "开关特技（Tricks on a Switch）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:87
#: a40955836b5c43929d4900ba3bbd52dc
msgid ""
"In addition to allowing LUA scripts to take over the vehicles rate "
"controllers during AUTO missions as described above, they can also take "
"control in normal modes like CRUISE or FBWA. This requires that the script:"
msgstr ""
"除了允许 LUA 脚本在如上所述的 AUTO 任务期间接管飞机速率控制器外，它们还可以在 CRUISE 或 FBWA "
"等正常飞行模式下接管控制。这要求脚本："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:89
#: b220a349bed64fbb8a50e865f2375ec5
msgid ""
"Enable the  feature with a specific call "
"\"vehicle:nav_scripting_enable(..)\" which returns a boolean indicating  "
"success or failure."
msgstr "通过特定调用 「vehicle:nav_scripting_enable(..)」启用该功能，该调用返回布尔值表示成功或失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:91
#: 9d2cfdc2758b44bc9c787bb513e78f7d
msgid ""
"Call the \"vehicle:set_target_throttle_rpy(....)\" function regularly (at "
"least every 50ms) to set the roll/pitch/yaw rates and throttle percentage. "
"Failure to do so, will disable the control overide and return control to the"
" original flight mode. Changing flight modes also disables script control."
msgstr ""
"定期（至少每 50ms）调用 "
"「vehicle:set_target_throttle_rpy(....)」函数来设置横滚/俯仰/偏航速率和油门百分比。若未及时调用，将禁用控制覆盖并将控制权返还给原飞行模式。切换飞行模式也会禁用脚本控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:93
#: ef9c6b69dab0441eb1b997c5032787b3
msgid ""
"This allows the implementation of \"Tricks on a Switch\" where an activation"
" switch driving an RC channel is used to enable an aerobatics trick script, "
"which is selected by another RC channel. An example system is given `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/Aerobatics/Via_Switch>`_."
msgstr ""
"这使得「开关特技」的实现成为可能：通过控制 RC 通道的激活开关来启用特技脚本，并由另一个 RC 通道进行选择。`此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/Aerobatics/Via_Switch>`_"
" 提供了一个示例系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:95
#: 77455fc08039450984c92c306c5495fd
msgid ""
"This consists of a small control script to read the RC channels for trick "
"selection and activation, and individual trick maneuver scripts for up to 10"
" different tricks. This allows the exchange of tricks between users, with, "
"at most, the change in a text editor of a given trick's ID number to fit "
"into the new user's list of trick scripts loaded on his SD card."
msgstr ""
"该系统由一个小型控制脚本组成，用于读取特技选择和激活的 RC 通道，以及最多 10 "
"个不同特技的单独特技动作脚本。这允许用户之间共享特技，最多只需在文本编辑器中修改给定特技的 ID 编号，以适应新用户 SD 卡上加载的特技脚本列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:97
#: 46882a86eab04621825ab8f16305241b
msgid ""
"In order to create new tricks, a user needs to have some LUA script creation"
" knowledge, but the task is simplified since they can use existing tricks as"
" templates for the creation of new tricks."
msgstr "要创建新特技，用户需要具备一定的 LUA 脚本创作知识，但由于可以使用现有特技作为模板，这项任务已大为简化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:99
#: 3f29b20a2c014af29ac8712ba03ee0ef
msgid ""
"As above, using SITL, especially in conjunction with "
":ref:`RealFlight<dev:sitl-with-realflight>` and a RealFlight model like the "
"`AddictionX "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/SITL_Models/tree/master/RealFlight/Released_Models/Planes/Addiction_3D>`__,"
" makes development and debugging much easier without risking a real vehicle."
msgstr ""
"如上所述，使用 SITL，尤其是结合 :ref:`RealFlight<dev:sitl-with-realflight>` 和类似 "
"`AddictionX "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/SITL_Models/tree/master/RealFlight/Released_Models/Planes/Addiction_3D>`__"
" 的 RealFlight 模型，可在不损坏实机的情况下大幅简化开发和调试工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:101
#: 1e9d7ce46009474a9f1abe17f36fdd7b
msgid "Below is an introductory video to \"Trick on a Switch\":"
msgstr "以下是「开关特技」的入门介绍视频："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:106
#: c6be6908b760424f928bd0668d4407da
msgid ""
"Here is a video on showing the development of a new trick for Tricks on a "
"Switch:"
msgstr "以下是展示为开关特技开发新特技的视频："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:111
#: 628073eba01348aeab40e1d7190a30b0
msgid "Setup Instructions for Example Tricks on a Switch Scripts"
msgstr "示例开关特技脚本的配置说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:113
#: 721a42fee59a48feb8f0362e1e8e1302
msgid ""
"Make sure you have Autotuned your plane and that its capable of doing "
"aerobatics in ACRO mode well (Bixlers and flying wings only can do rolls and"
" loops, generally....no yaw authority...ie should be able to knife edge for "
"full capability). This includes Autotuning the new YAW rate controller. "
"Enable :ref:`YAW_RATE_ENABLE<YAW_RATE_ENABLE>` and set "
":ref:`ACRO_YAW_RATE<ACRO_YAW_RATE>` appropriately (90deg/s is a good start)."
" When you Autotune, not only do pitch and roll, but also yaw by exercising "
"the rudder, like pitch and roll."
msgstr ""
"确保已对飞机进行 Autotune，且飞机能在 Acro 模式下良好执行特技飞行（Bixler "
"和飞翼一般只能做横滚和筋斗……没有偏航控制权限……即应能做刀锋飞行才具备完整能力）。这包括对新的偏航速率控制器进行 Autotune。启用 "
":ref:`YAW_RATE_ENABLE<YAW_RATE_ENABLE>` 并适当设置 "
":ref:`ACRO_YAW_RATE<ACRO_YAW_RATE>` （90度/秒是个好的起点）。进行 Autotune "
"时，不仅要做俯仰和横滚，还要通过拨动方向舵进行偏航，方式与俯仰和横滚相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:114
#: cb486ba0e5e94cb2b4170fd109636c38
msgid ""
"Enable scripting, on an autopilot that is capable (F7 or H7) with "
":ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>` =1 and :ref:`SCR_HEAP_SIZE<SCR_HEAP_SIZE>` = "
"200000 (which will allow four trick scripts + AUTO mission scripting in the "
"future)."
msgstr ""
"在具备能力的飞控（F7 或 H7）上通过 :ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>` =1 启用脚本，并设置 "
":ref:`SCR_HEAP_SIZE<SCR_HEAP_SIZE>` = 200000（可支持四个特技脚本以及未来的 AUTO 任务脚本）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:115
#: 287cbd1dfe1744288bbc7022bbd8235f
msgid ""
"Copy the "
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/Aerobatics/Via_Switch"
" scripts into your SD card APM/scripts directory. Use the RAW view and copy "
"to files on the SD card using the same names."
msgstr ""
"将 "
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/Aerobatics/Via_Switch"
" 中的脚本复制到 SD 卡的 APM/scripts 目录，使用 RAW 视图查看并使用相同文件名复制到 SD 卡。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:116
#: f17fb2fcc1b84ba6aca89e6af5d5907a
msgid ""
"Assign an RC channel to ``RCx_OPTION`` = 300 for the trick activation switch"
" (low=disable,mid=show trick number selected, high= do it) and one for 301 "
"which is trick selection. You can use a three position for 0/5/10 trick id "
"selection setup to ``RCx_OPTION`` = 301. 0 is disable, 5 is the knife edge, "
"10 is the loop/immelman example using the above scripts."
msgstr ""
"将 RC 通道分配 ``RCx_OPTION`` = 300 作为特技激活开关（低=禁用，中=显示所选特技编号，高=执行），另一个分配 301 "
"作为特技选择。可使用三段位开关以 ``RCx_OPTION`` = 301 进行 0/5/10 特技 ID 选择设置。0 为禁用，5 为刀锋飞行，10 "
"为使用上述脚本的筋斗/Immelmann 示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:117
#: 351dbd22cefb4586ab1e77776d22ac50
msgid ""
"Upon boot you should see messages that show the trick 5(knife-edge) and "
"10(loop/immelman) are loaded. Setting the activation switch to mid position "
"will identify the trick number selected by the selection channel on the "
"ground station or TX, if running :ref:`Yaapu <common-frsky-yaapu>` "
"telemetry."
msgstr ""
"启动后应看到消息显示特技 5（刀锋飞行）和 10（筋斗/Immelmann）已加载。将激活开关拨至中间位置，可在地面站或遥控器上（如运行 "
":ref:`Yaapu <common-frsky-yaapu>` 数传）显示选择通道所选的特技编号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:118
#: efb3759bf7804718a288b3af8dc0ba8b
msgid ""
"In the Ground Control Station's parameter lists, you should see a set of "
"\"AERO\" params....the ``AERO_TRICK_RAT`` sets the loop pitch rate, try "
"90deg/s, ``AERO_RPT_COUNT`` sets the number of loops or if 0, an immelman. "
"``AERO_TRICK_ANG`` set the knife-edge trick angle 0 to 180 or -180 deg that "
"will be executed as long as you have the activation switch high. Using the "
"GCS or :ref:`Yaapu GCS<common-yaapu-gcs>` or :ref:`CRSF parameter "
"editor<common-crsf-telemetry>`, you can change these in air to vary the "
"trick characteristics, if you wish"
msgstr ""
"在地面站的参数列表中，应看到一组 「AERO」 参数…… ``AERO_TRICK_RAT`` 设置筋斗俯仰速率（尝试 "
"90度/秒），``AERO_RPT_COUNT`` 设置筋斗次数（若为 0 则为 Immelmann）。``AERO_TRICK_ANG`` "
"设置刀锋飞行角度，范围 0 到 180 或 -180 度，在激活开关拨高期间持续执行。可使用地面站或 :ref:`Yaapu GCS<common-"
"yaapu-gcs>` 或 :ref:`CRSF 参数编辑器<common-crsf-telemetry>` 在飞行中更改这些值以调整特技特性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:119
#: 06f3b8417c054e6a969a917cd8c924dc
msgid ""
"You can bail out of the trick by putting activation switch low, change "
"modes, or set selector to 0"
msgstr "可通过将激活开关拨低、切换飞行模式或将选择器置为 0 来中止特技。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:121
#: c36892c71ec24a9786c8184db339e6d4
msgid ""
"Remember: ALTITUDE IS YOUR FRIEND! dont attempt your first one below "
"200feet! and FPV is a good way to try it out first, if you have trouble with"
" seeing the vehicle at that altitude."
msgstr "记住：高度是你的朋友！首次尝试不要低于 200 英尺！如果在该高度难以看清飞机，FPV 是一个很好的试飞方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:124
#: a9c10321ebdb4a3697ceaede0ff8aa6a
msgid "Tuning for Aerobatics"
msgstr "特技飞行调参"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-aerobatics.rst:126
#: c7fbb526cea8490a84827261f8b8581a
msgid ""
"Normal ArduPilot Autotune provides a safe, stable PID tune for most "
"vehicles. As such, its not optimized for precision aerobatics which require "
"a tight tune. See below:"
msgstr ""
"正常的 ArduPilot Autotune 为大多数飞机提供安全稳定的 PID 调参。因此，它并未针对需要精确调参的精准特技飞行进行优化。请参见下文："
